# Tools and Technologies

The following Microsoft Fabric components and technologies were used to build this solution.

| Category | Technology |
|-----------|------------|
| **Platform** | Microsoft Fabric |
| **Storage** | OneLake |
| **Data Storage** | Lakehouse |
| **Data Warehouse** | Fabric Data Warehouse |
| **Data Ingestion** | Spark SQL Notebook |
| **Data Transformation** | T-SQL |
| **Pipeline Orchestration** | Microsoft Fabric Data Pipelines |
| **Data Model** | Single Denormalized Gold Fact Table |
| **Semantic Layer** | Power BI Semantic Model (Direct Lake) |
| **Reporting** | Power BI |
| **Analytics Language** | DAX |
| **Security** | Row-Level Security (RLS) |
| **File Format** | CSV |
